<title>USA: Dallas, Pa., school bonds yield 5.625 pct in 2014.</title>
<headline>Dallas, Pa., school bonds yield 5.625 pct in 2014.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>PNC Capital Markets Inc said Monday it tentatively priced $5 million Dallas School District, Pa., general obligation bonds at a top yield of 5.625 percent in 2014.</p>
<p>The preliminary pricing follows:  </p>
<p>DALLAS SCHOOL DISTRICT</p>
<p>RE: $5,000,000*</p>
<p>LUZERNE COUNTY, PENNSYLVANIA</p>
<p>GENERAL OBLIGATION BONDS, SERIES 1996</p>
<p>BANK QUALIFIED</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aaa		   S&amp;P: NAF</p>
<p>FGIC INSURED</p>
<p>    DATED: 11/15/1996	  FIRST COUPON: 08/15/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 02/15</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	  PRICE</p>
<p>02/15/1999		    5M    4.20  %	100.00</p>
